          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اتحادیه (ettehâdiye) — \"a union, an association\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اتحادیه کارگران با مدیرها مذاکره کرد. ettehâdiye-ye kârgarân bâ modirhâ mozâkere kard. The workers' union negotiated with the managers."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Ettehâd \"unity\" + -iye. Ettehâdiye-ye kârgari — a trade union."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اتحادیه (ettehâdiye) is built on ettehâd \"unity\", usually traced to Arabic ittiḥād \"becoming one\", with the ending -iye."
            }
          ]
        },
