              "text": "بالاخره در امتحان موفق شد. bâlâkhare dar emtehân movaffaq shod. In the end she passed the exam."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Movaffaq \"successful\" + shodan. Dar chizi movaffaq shodan — to succeed in something."
